d=Text("Access to sights: Good for reaching central and many major sights by taxi or auto, with practical location near the city center.[3]",variant="body")
e=Text("Transport: Strong road access and usually easier ride-hailing connectivity than outer areas",variant="body")
f=Text("Atmosphere: Quieter, more residential, and typically less hectic than the oldcity core.",variant="body")
g=Text("Main drawback: Not most walkable or characterful area if you want bazaars and heritage streets right outside the hotel.",variant="body")
h=Text("C-Scheme / central Jaipur","h3")
