k=Text("Access to sights: One of the best around bases for first visit because it sits close to core and city amenities.[6]",variant="body")
l=Text("Transport: Easy to move around by cab, auto, and local roads making day planning straightforward.",variant="body")
m=Text("Atmosphere: Busy, urban and convenient, with a more modern city feel.",variant="body")
